<http://data.silknow.org/object/c2d8a46a-a644-3fa8-8e24-2b45db533cfc/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Apron of plain woven silk fabric, with patterns in pierced work and white paste.\n\nThe upper portion is occupied by ten narrow vertical bands with wavy stripes and flowers tied by bows, on a circular lace-like mesh: the plain spaces between are pointed with detached sprays. Below are festoons, tasselled cords and pendant medallions containing birds. There is a wide border on three sides of wavy floral stems and leaf ornament also on a circular lace like mesh."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/c2d8a46a-a644-3fa8-8e24-2b45db533cfc> .

